{"slug": "api-error-envelope-migration", "title": "Error Envelope Migration — v1 → v2", "blocks": [{"id": "b1", "type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Sunset policy"}, {"id": "b2", "type": "ingress", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "v1 is "}, {"type": "text", "value": "not scheduled for removal.", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " Minimum runway after v2 GA is one minor release; actual sunset will be announced explicitly in this document. TUI and curl-based workflows depend on the v1 shape and need a coordinated migration. Until the announcement lands, treat v1 as permanent."}]}, {"id": "b3", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Rollout when scheduled:"}]}, {"id": "b4", "type": "list", "ordered": true, "items": [[{"type": "text", "value": "v2 becomes default; v1 works via "}, {"type": "text", "value": "Accept-Version: 1", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": "."}], [{"type": "text", "value": "v1 emits "}, {"type": "text", "value": "Deprecation", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " response header (RFC 8594 / RFC 9745) with a sunset date."}], [{"type": "text", "value": "v1 removed; requests without "}, {"type": "text", "value": "Accept-Version", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " get v2."}]]}, {"id": "b5", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Each step is gated on the public Studio + TUI clients confirming they have moved."}]}, {"id": "b6", "type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Why v2"}, {"id": "b7", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Phase 3 introduced a structured error envelope so SDK clients, pipeline tools, and Studio can render per-field validation diagnostics without parsing free-form strings."}]}, {"id": "b8", "type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Wire shapes"}, {"id": "b9", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Select with "}, {"type": "text", "value": "Accept-Version: 2", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text